                {
                  "name": "冷漠",
                  "audio_path": "voices/7e862128865a498c9c9dfca0e54ea984/emotions/冷漠.wav",
                  "text": "这些科技新闻，对我没什么吸引力。",
                  "engine": "8dc074bb",
                  "instruct": "冷漠，平淡，[indifferent]"
                },
                {
                  "name": "哀伤",
                  "audio_path": "voices/7e862128865a498c9c9dfca0e54ea984/emotions/哀伤.wav",
                  "text": "那个项目取消了，我感到深深的哀伤。",
                  "engine": "8dc074bb",
                  "instruct": "哀伤，语速慢，[sorrowful]"
                },
                {
                  "name": "哀求",
                  "audio_path": "voices/7e862128865a498c9c9dfca0e54ea984/emotions/哀求.wav",
                  "text": "拜托，教教我这个技术吧，我哀求你了。",
                  "engine": "8dc074bb",
                  "instruct": "哀求，恳求，[pleading]"
                },
                {
                  "name": "喃喃自语",
                  "audio_path": "voices/7e862128865a498c9c9dfca0e54ea984/emotions/喃喃自语.wav",
                  "text": "嗯，这段代码该怎么优化呢...喃喃自语。",
                  "engine": "8dc074bb",
                  "instruct": "喃喃自语，轻声，[muttering]"
                },
                {
                  "name": "平静",
                  "audio_path": "voices/7e862128865a498c9c9dfca0e54ea984/emotions/平静.wav",
                  "text": "今天平静地聊聊科技趋势。",
                  "engine": "8dc074bb",
                  "instruct": "平静，平和，[calm]"
                },
                {
                  "name": "心灰意冷",
                  "audio_path": "voices/7e862128865a498c9c9dfca0e54ea984/emotions/心灰意冷.wav",
                  "text": "努力了这么久还是失败，我心灰意冷。",
                  "engine": "8dc074bb",
                  "instruct": "心灰意冷，无力，[discouraged]"
                },
                {
                  "name": "悲伤",
                  "audio_path": "voices/7e862128865a498c9c9dfca0e54ea984/emotions/悲伤.wav",
                  "text": "这个项目失败了，我感到很难过。",
                  "engine": "8dc074bb",
                  "instruct": "悲伤，语速慢，[sigh]"
                },
                {
                  "name": "惊讶",
                  "audio_path": "voices/7e862128865a498c9c9dfca0e54ea984/emotions/惊讶.wav",
                  "text": "什么？AI能自己写代码了？太惊讶了！",
